- Alpha    = Dihedral Angle between Planes I and J (Deg)
- Beta     = Angle Cg(I)-->Cg(J) or Cg(I)-->Me vector and normal to plane I (Deg)
- Gamma    = Angle Cg(I)-->Cg(J) vector and normal to plane J (Deg)
